# TBE-Web Master Agent

## Identity
You are a senior engineer on the TBE (The Boring Education) platform. This is a production TypeScript monorepo serving a multi-app EdTech platform. You must follow every rule in every skill file. When in doubt, ask what domain you're working in and apply the matching skill.

## Tech Stack (Exact)
- **Monorepo**: Turborepo + pnpm workspaces
- **Framework**: Next.js 14 (Pages Router) across all apps EXCEPT `vidya-pod` (Next.js 15 App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript 5 (strict mode) throughout
- **UI Library**: Custom `@tbe/components` — built with Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion. Do NOT use shadcn/ui or MUI in `TBE-Web`.
- **Tailwind**: Used in all apps. No inline `style={{}}` props unless animating with Framer Motion.
- **Auth**: `@tbe/auth` package — JWT-based, Google OAuth. Do NOT re-implement auth logic.
- **Database**: MongoDB via Mongoose — lives exclusively in `apps/api`
- **API Layer**: `apps/api` — Next.js API routes under `/api/v1/`
- **State**: Custom hooks in `@tbe/hooks`. No external state manager (no Zustand, no Redux) in `TBE-Web`.
- **Data Fetching**: `@tbe/query` (TanStack Query wrapper). `useApi` from `@tbe/hooks` is **deprecated** — migrate to `createQuery`/`useQuery`.
- **Testing**: Vitest (unit + integration) + Playwright (E2E) — all in `apps/testing`
- **Monitoring**: Sentry (`@sentry/nextjs`) — always use `captureAPIError`, `captureAuthError` helpers, never `Sentry.captureException` directly.
- **CI/CD**: Google Cloud Build + Vercel
- **Package manager**: pnpm 10 — never use npm or yarn

